  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>January 7, 2026</TD>
    <TD>Wenshan Xie</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>Chairman of the Board and Chief Executive Officer </TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>IMPORTANT NOTICE REGARDING THE AVAILABILITY
OF PROXY MATERIALS FOR THE<BR>
<FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase">Extraordinary Meeting of Members TO BE</FONT> HELD ON JANUARY 23, 2026</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This Notice and Proxy Statement are available
online at https://ts.vstocktransfer.com/irhlogin/I-EHOME and please find them under the &ldquo;Documents &amp; Forms&rdquo; tab. This
Notice and Proxy Statement are also available online at https://www.ej111.com/</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

